{"text":"<p></p><p></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6XABf5YECbQ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3.190026\">00:03</span> ### Dhammānulome tikatikapaṭṭhānaṃ ^7-57-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-1. Kusalattika-vedanāttikaṃ ^7-57a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Sukhāyavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-57b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6.744572\">00:06</span> 1. Kusalaṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57c-1</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20.885144\">00:20</span> Akusalaṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"32.342875\">00:32</span> Abyākataṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"44.347863\">00:44</span>  2. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ…pe… sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) ^7-57c-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"55.842531\">00:55</span> 3. Kusalo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo kusalassa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-57c-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"66.967733\">01:06</span> Akusalo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo akusalassa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"78.630717\">01:18</span> Abyākato sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo abyākatassa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"90.716824\">01:30</span> Kusalo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo kusalassa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"102.669262\">01:42</span> 4. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57c-4</p><p><br /></p><p>(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Dukkhāyavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-57d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"112.61383\">01:52</span> 5. Akusalaṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57e-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"127.909376\">02:07</span> Akusalaṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"140.152639\">02:20</span> Abyākataṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"153.27494\">02:33</span> 6. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) ^7-57e-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"164.336771\">02:44</span> 7. Akusalo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo akusalassa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-57e-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"175.591882\">02:55</span> Akusalo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo akusalassa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"186.956476\">03:06</span> Abyākato dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo akusalassa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"199.758806\">03:19</span> 8. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-57e-8</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Adukkhamasukhavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-57f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"210.141229\">03:30</span> 9. Kusalaṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57g-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"231.038098\">03:51</span> Akusalaṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"243.951609\">04:03</span> Abyākataṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"257.232599\">04:17</span> 10. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-57g-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"267.909281\">04:27</span> 11. Kusalo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo kusalassa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-57g-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"279.941168\">04:39</span> Akusalo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo akusalassa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"292.462945\">04:52</span> Abyākato adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo abyākatassa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"305.516288\">05:05</span> 12. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare satta…pe… upanissaye nava, avigate tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-57g-12</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-2. Kusalattika-vipākattikaṃ ^7-57h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"321.873146\">05:21</span> 13. Abyākataṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57i-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"334.301406\">05:34</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"344.697844\">05:44</span> 14. Kusalaṃ vipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo vipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57i-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"352.798853\">05:52</span> Akusalaṃ vipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo vipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"361.598617\">06:01</span> Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"371.206372\">06:11</span> 15. Kusalo vipākadhammadhammo kusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-57i-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"379.360829\">06:19</span> Akusalo vipākadhammadhammo akusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"387.334557\">06:27</span> Kusalo vipākadhammadhammo kusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo vipākadhammadhammo akusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"405.161184\">06:45</span> Akusalo vipākadhammadhammo akusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo vipākadhammadhammo kusalassa vipākadhammadhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"421.516447\">07:01</span> 16. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe cattāri, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare dve…pe… sahajāte dve, upanissaye cattāri…pe… avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-57i-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"438.144794\">07:18</span> 17. Abyākataṃ nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57i-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"450.77574\">07:30</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-3. Kusalattika-upādinnattikaṃ ^7-57j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"461.05677\">07:41</span> 18. Abyākataṃ upādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato upādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57k-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"476.417011\">07:56</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"484.769083\">08:04</span> 19. Kusalaṃ anupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-57k-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"495.77123\">08:15</span> Akusalaṃ anupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"506.830369\">08:26</span> Abyākataṃ anupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>Kusalaṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca abyākataṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p>Akusalaṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca abyākataṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"519.54907\">08:39</span> 20. Hetuyā nava, avigate nava. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) ^7-57k-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"528.043354\">08:48</span> 21. Kusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo kusalassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-57k-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"542.528847\">09:02</span> Akusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo akusalassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"553.155249\">09:13</span> Abyākato anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo abyākatassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"564.232402\">09:24</span> 22. Kusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo kusalassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-57k-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"576.063291\">09:36</span> Akusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo akusalassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"587.486901\">09:47</span> Abyākato anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo abyākatassa anupādinnupādāniyassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"599.116066\">09:59</span> 23. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, avigate ekādasa. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57k-23</p><p><br /></p><p>(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"610.310195\">10:10</span> 24. Kusalaṃ anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57k-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"621.602205\">10:21</span> Abyākataṃ anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinnaanupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"633.519911\">10:33</span> Hetuyā dve, avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi sabbattha vitthāro.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-4. Kusalattika-saṃkiliṭṭhattikaṃ ^7-57l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"644.092005\">10:44</span> 25. Akusalaṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-57m-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"656.437543\">10:56</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"665.17225\">11:05</span> 26. Kusalaṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-57m-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"676.254409\">11:16</span> Abyākataṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Kusalaṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikañca abyākataṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"688.341651\">11:28</span> 27. Hetuyā pañca, avigate pañca. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāro.) ^7-57m-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"697.618537\">11:37</span> 28. Kusalaṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57m-28</p><p><br /></p><p>Abyākataṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"712.012898\">11:52</span> Hetuyā dve…pe… avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-5. Kusalattika-vitakkattikaṃ ^7-57n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-57o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"720.748526\">12:00</span> 29. Kusalaṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo savitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-57o-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"733.837421\">12:13</span> Akusalaṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo savitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"743.530115\">12:23</span> Abyākataṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato savitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"753.945211\">12:33</span> Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, avigate tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi 